      {
        "text": "Lord Sky Crane of Immortal Crane Sect first uses this Gu on Qing Mao Mountain while fighting First gen Gu Yue, after the two have already clashed as rank five peak stage Gu Masters. The chapter title prints the shorter form Raising Eyebrows & Exhale; the Gu itself is named Raise Eyebrows & Exhale Gu in the fight narration.",
        "chapters": [
          192
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
