          "loc_qing_mao_mountain",
          "char_first_gen_gu_yue",
          "fac_gu_masters"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When his consciousness returns, he is already coiled by the white eyebrows and sees Lord Sky Crane still running Raise Eyebrows & Exhale Gu to exhaust First gen Gu Yue.",
        "chapters": [
          196
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "spring-autumn-cicada-rebirth",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "First gen Gu Yue later still remembers Fang Yuan taking the initiative to grab the white eyebrows and help burn Lord Sky Crane’s essence, which pushes wavering villagers to commit as well.",
